sequenceDiagram

    participant Game as Unity Game
    participant Recorder as Trial / Session Recorder
    participant Uploader as DataUploader
    participant API as Analytics API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Game->>Recorder: Player completes trial

    Recorder->>Recorder: Record result
    Recorder->>Recorder: Add trial to session

    Game->>Recorder: Session / day completed

    Recorder->>Uploader: SessionUploadRequest

    Uploader->>Uploader: Normalize payload
    Uploader->>Uploader: Serialize JSON

    Uploader->>API: POST /api/analytics/upload

    alt Upload succeeds
        API->>DB: Persist player/session/trials
        DB-->>API: Saved
        API-->>Uploader: 2xx Response
        Uploader-->>Game: Upload successful
    else Upload fails
        API-->>Uploader: Error response
        Uploader-->>Game: Upload failed
    end